---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Form from '../../components/Form.astro'
---

<Layout title="Register – M-Gate">
	<!-- Hero -->
	<section class="grid- min-h-[min(calc(100svh-16rem),48rem)]- place-items-center- pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-20 md:pb-16 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-20" data-theme="default">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-8 text-center lg:px-12">
			<div class="mb-3 font-bold text-foreground-muted xl:text-lg">
				<p>Consectetur adipiscing elit</p>
			</div>

			<h1 class="mx-auto mb-6 max-w-[16ch] text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl">
				<p>Register</p>
			</h1>

			<div class="mx-auto prose prose-xl max-w-[56ch] text-foreground-muted md:prose-2xl">
				<p>Where can I get more in-depth information? Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit vitae quo animi suspendisse luctus tortor.</p>
			</div>

			<div hidden class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
				<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-xl">View leaderboard</a>
				<a href="#" class="btn btn-outline btn-xl">Read methodology</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section hidden class="py-20" data-theme="default">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-8 lg:px-12">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-lg">
				<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Get access</h1>
				<p class="mt-3 text-base text-foreground-muted">Register to explore the full M-Gate dataset, including detailed per-language and per-domain breakdowns.</p>

				<form class="mt-10 grid gap-5">
					<div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
						<div>
							<label for="first-name" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">First name</label>
							<input id="first-name" type="text" name="first_name" autocomplete="given-name" class="input w-full" placeholder="Jane" required />
						</div>
						<div>
							<label for="last-name" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Last name</label>
							<input id="last-name" type="text" name="last_name" autocomplete="family-name" class="input w-full" placeholder="Smith" required />
						</div>
					</div>

					<div>
						<label for="email" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Work email</label>
						<input id="email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" class="input w-full" placeholder="jane@company.com" required />
					</div>

					<div>
						<label for="company" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Company</label>
						<input id="company" type="text" name="company" autocomplete="organization" class="input w-full" placeholder="Acme Corp" />
					</div>

					<div>
						<label for="role" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Role</label>
						<select id="role" name="role" class="input w-full">
							<option value="" disabled selected>Select your role</option>
							<option>AI / ML Engineer</option>
							<option>Data Scientist</option>
							<option>Localization Manager</option>
							<option>Product Manager</option>
							<option>Researcher</option>
							<option>Other</option>
						</select>
					</div>

					<div>
						<label for="use-case" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">How will you use the data? <span class="font-normal text-foreground-subtle">(optional)</span></label>
						<textarea id="use-case" name="use_case" rows="3" class="input w-full resize-none" placeholder="e.g. evaluating models for our multilingual product..."></textarea>
					</div>

					<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<input id="agree" type="checkbox" name="agree" class="mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 accent-accent" required />
						<label for="agree" class="text-sm text-foreground-muted">I agree to the <a href="#" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline">terms of use</a> and <a href="#" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline">privacy policy</a>.</label>
					</div>

					<button type="submit" class="btn btn-tertiary btn-lg w-full">Request access</button>
				</form>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Text + stats / Form -->
	<section class="pt-12 pb-12 md:pt-16 md:pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-20" data-theme="dots">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-screen-xl items-center gap-12 px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-12 xl:gap-16">
			<div class="lg:col-span-7">
				<div class="mb-3 font-bold text-foreground-muted xl:text-lg">
					<p>This is the subheading</p>
				</div>

				<h2 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight xl:text-5xl">
					<p>This is the heading</p>
				</h2>

				<div class="prose text-foreground-muted md:prose-lg">
					<p>Donec ut cursus est. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse luctus tortor placerat erat consequat, pellentesque venenatis felis.</p>

					<ul>
						<li>
							<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing.</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing.</p>
						</li>
					</ul>

					<p>Aenean aliquet tellus nec tempor semper. Etiam finibus ex ac neque semper interdum. Nam in mauris vitae enim egestas euismod semper sit amet.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
					<a href="/m-gate" class="btn btn-secondary btn-icon-right">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect><line x1="40" y1="128" x2="216" y2="128" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></line><polyline points="168 80 216 128 168 176" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></polyline></svg>
						Find out more
					</a>
				</div>

				<hr class="mt-12 mb-8" />

				<!-- Stats -->
				<div class="mt-8">
					<!-- border-t pt-8 -->
					<ul class="@container/stats flex flex-wrap justify-start gap-x-[min(5cqi,2rem)] gap-y-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)]">
						<li class="flex items-center">
							<span class="intersect-once text-[min(7.5cqi,3rem)]/none font-extrabold intersect:motion-preset-focus" style="--motion-delay: 200ms">42k</span>

							<div class="intersect-once pl-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)] text-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)]/snug text-foreground-muted intersect:motion-preset-slide-right-sm" style="--motion-delay: 200ms">
								<div>Our Active</div>
								<div>Users</div>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li class="flex items-center">
							<span class="intersect-once text-[min(7.5cqi,3rem)]/none font-extrabold intersect:motion-preset-focus" style="--motion-delay: 300ms">3k</span>

							<div class="intersect-once pl-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)] text-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)]/snug text-foreground-muted intersect:motion-preset-slide-right-sm" style="--motion-delay: 300ms">
								<div>Professional</div>
								<div>Creators</div>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li class="flex items-center">
							<span class="intersect-once text-[min(7.5cqi,3rem)]/none font-extrabold intersect:motion-preset-focus" style="--motion-delay: 400ms">560k</span>

							<div class="intersect-once pl-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)] text-[min(2.5cqi,1rem)]/snug text-foreground-muted intersect:motion-preset-slide-right-sm" style="--motion-delay: 400ms">
								<div>Weekly</div>
								<div>Downloads</div>
							</div>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="h-full lg:col-span-5">
				<div class="rounded-lg border p-8" data-theme="default">
					<h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">
						<p>Get access today</p>
					</h3>

					<div class="prose mb-6 text-foreground-muted">
						<p>Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit obcaecati numquam recusandae architecto delectus.</p>
					</div>

					<Form variant="split" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
